# Normalize all text files to LF on checkout and in the repo, regardless of
# which OS/tool (Windows git, WSL git) touches them -- this repo previously
# had CRLF vs LF churn from being edited via both. `text=auto` lets git's
# own binary-detection heuristic skip anything it doesn't think is text;
# the explicit `binary` rules below are a safety net for known binary types.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.pdf binary
*.sqlite binary
*.sqlite3 binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
